    <string name="paste_cookie_title">Paste cookie</string>
    <string name="paste_cookie_instructions">Google blocks sign-in from embedded browsers like this one\'s WebView - no phone-only fix gets around that reliably. This does, all on this phone, no computer needed:\n\n1. In a Firefox-based browser that supports extensions (Firefox, Fennec, Iceraven…), install the free \"Cookie-Editor\" add-on from its Settings → Add-ons.\n2. Tap \"Open YouTube in browser\" below and sign in there normally (a real browser isn\'t blocked the way this WebView is).\n3. On the signed-in youtube.com page, open Cookie-Editor → Export → \"Header String\" - it copies the cookie to your clipboard.\n4. Come back here and tap \"Paste from clipboard\" below.</string>
